00:07:12.567 --> 00:07:16.600
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:07:17.199 --> 00:07:22.144
<v Slow>流れ星の見ごろは、いつですか。

00:07:22.944 --> 00:07:30.456
<v Host>From the night of the twelfth to the morning of the thirteenth, and from the night of the thirteenth to the morning of the fourteenth.

00:07:31.055 --> 00:07:37.896
<v Slow>今年、星がとてもよく見えるのは、どうしてですか。

00:07:38.696 --> 00:07:44.432
<v Host>Because the thirteenth is a new moon — there is no moonlight, so the sky is very dark.

00:07:45.031 --> 00:07:53.384
<v Slow>空が暗い場所では、1時間に何個ぐらいの流れ星が見えますか。

00:07:54.184 --> 00:07:57.495
<v Host>About thirty-five shooting stars in one hour.

00:07:58.096 --> 00:08:10.791
<v Host>That's all for today. If the sky is clear tonight, find a safe, dark place, look up, and wait a little — you might catch a falling star. Don't forget to make a wish. See you tomorrow!

00:08:11.391 --> 00:08:13.791
<v News>また明日。
